msgstr "Kamerani tanlashda xatolik yuz berdi"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Tanlangan kamerani ochib bo‘lmaydi"

#: src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Boshqasini tanlashga harakat qiling"

#: src/onboarding.py:639
msgid ""
"Please visit\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-em"
"itter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\nto en"
"able your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Marhamat tashrif buyuring\n<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux"
"-enable-ir-emitter\">https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitt"
"er</a>\nir emitentingizni yoqish uchun"

#: src/onboarding.py:704
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Yoritishni sozlash 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Yoritishni sozlash 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:723
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Yuz modeli saqlanmadi"

#: src/onboarding.py:728 src/onboarding.py:775
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Ikkinchi modelni skanerlang"

#: src/onboarding.py:734
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Ikkinchi modelni yozib bo‘lmadi"

#: src/onboarding.py:735
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must "
"still be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than"
" turning it off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from S"
"ettings."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi modelingiz saqlandi, shuning uchun yuz bilan login allaqachon"
" ishlaydi. Xona yuzingizni koʻrish uchun yetarli darajada yorugʻ boʻli"
"shi kerak — yorugʻlikni oʻchirish oʻrniga uni oʻzgartiring, keyin qayt"
"a urinib koʻring yoki oʻtkazib yuborib, keyinroq Sozlamalar orqali mod"
"el qoʻshing."

#: src/onboarding.py:769
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Ikkinchi skanerlash: turli xil yoritish"

#: src/onboarding.py:771
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on o"
"r off, move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep y"
"our face clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi model saqlangan. Endi chiroqni o'zgartiring - masalan, chiroq"
"ni yoqing yoki o'chiring, derazadan uzoqlashing yoki xonaning boshqa y"
"orug'idan foydalaning - yuzingizni aniq ko'rinadigan qilib qo'ying, so"
"'ngra Scan tugmasini yana bosing."

#: src/onboarding.py:805
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Sozlash"

#: src/onboarding.py:818
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida {}-ni avtomatik ravishda"
" qulfdan chiqarishi mumkin (aniqlangan hamyon: {}).\n\n<b>TPM holati:<"
"/b> TPM apparat va vositalari tekshirilmoqda..."

#: src/onboarding.py:838
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida {}-ni avtomatik ravishda"
" qulfdan chiqarishi mumkin (aniqlangan hamyon: {}).\n\n<b>TPM holati:<"
"/b> TPM uskunasi aniqlandi. <i>tpm2-tools</i> avtomatik o'rnatilmoqda."
".."

#: src/onboarding.py:850
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida {}-ni avtomatik ravishda"
" qulfdan chiqarishi mumkin (aniqlangan hamyon: {}).\n\n<b>TPM holati:<"
"/b> Uskuna TPM 2.0 faol. Sizning parolingiz TPM ichida xavfsiz tarzda "
"muhrlanadi."

#: src/onboarding.py:852
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida {}-ni avtomatik ravishda"
" qulfdan chiqarishi mumkin (aniqlangan hamyon: {}).\n\n<b>TPM holati:<"
"/b> TPM uskunasi aniqlandi, lekin <i>tpm2-tools</i> avtomatik oʻrnatil"
"madi. <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>-ni ishga tushiring. Das"
"turiy ta'minotga asoslangan hisob ma'lumotlarini keshlashga qaytish."

#: src/onboarding.py:854
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello yuz autentifikatsiyasi yordamida {}-ni avtomatik ravishda"
" qulfdan chiqarishi mumkin (aniqlangan hamyon: {}).\n\n<b>TPM holati:<"
"/b> Hech qanday TPM uskunasi aniqlanmadi. Dasturiy ta'minotga asoslang"
"an hisob ma'lumotlarini keshlashdan foydalanish (AES-256-GCM)."

