#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Faqat bitta yuz modeli roʻyxatga olingan. Yoritish sizning yuzingiz ka"
"meraga qanday ko'rinishini o'zgartiradi, shuning uchun bitta model kec"
"hqurun lampalar ostida (yoki kunduzi) ishlamay qolishi mumkin. Kunning"
" istalgan vaqtida ishonchli qulfni ochish uchun boshqa yorug'likda yoz"
"ilgan ikkinchi modelni qo'shing."

