#: src/main.glade:655 src/onboarding.glade:116
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Kalitlar / KWallet Avtomatik qulfdan chiqarish"

#: src/main.glade:672
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Kirish kalitini avtomatik ravishda ochish uchun yuz autentifikatsiyasi"
"ni yoqing yoki tizimga kirishda KWallet. Bu mavjud bo'lganda TPM da mu"
"hrlangan yoki faqat ildiz kaliti yordamida AES-256-GCM bilan shifrlang"
"an parolingizni xavfsiz saqlaydi. Ish stolingizga qarab pam_gnome_keyr"
"ing yoki pam_kwallet5 uchun yuzni autentifikatsiya qilish PAM_AUTHTOK "
"oʻrnatiladi."

